## System Design and UML Diagrams

### 1. Overall System Architecture

The system is organized into three layers, all interconnected through a Unified Namespace (MQTT Broker):

```
+-----------------------------+           +-------------------------------+
|         SENSORS            |           |         CLOUD LAYER           |
|----------------------------|           |-------------------------------|
|  [Equipment (LME)]         |           |  Data Analysis & AI Models    |
|   - Current                |           |                               |
|   - Vibration              |           |   [Pub/Sub to Broker]         |
|   - Noise                  |           +-------------------------------+
|   - Temperature            |
|   - Humidity               |
|                            |           +-------------------------------+
|  [Environment]             |           |  DIGITAL TWIN PLATFORM        |
|   - Temperature            |           |-------------------------------|
|   - Humidity               |           |  3D Viewer (Three.js)         |
|   - Air Flow               |           |  BIM 3D Model                 |
|   - Infrared Camera        |           |  Predictive AI Model Viewer   |
|   - Ultrasonic Sensors     |           |  Web Interface                |
|                            |           |   [Pub/Sub to Broker]         |
+-------------+--------------+           +-------------------------------+
              |
              | Pub
              v
    +-----------------------------+
    |   Unified Namespace (UNS)   |
    |     MQTT Broker             |
    +-----------------------------+
```

